 "_about": "ammo_pool = spare rounds a full pool of this gun body holds (every gun of the body shares it; a reload takes from it). move_speed / aim_speed = top speed carrying it / aiming with it, Source units a second (the knife runs at data/movement.json base_speed). Optional (sea step 2 bodies): range (m, hitscan reach; default the game's shot range), falloff {from, to, min} (damage x1 up to `from` m, down to x`min` at `to` m), knockback (m/s push on every enemy a shot hits, not bosses), burn {dps, seconds} (every hit sets it burning), fan {tap_rate, spread_mult} (a fresh trigger press may fire at tap_rate, wider), reload_each (one round per reload_time, a shot interrupts), overheat {per_shot, cool_per_second}. projectile kinds harpoon / flare / bolt hit with the gun's own damage (game/shot_bolts.gd): harpoon pin_seconds, pull_speed, pull_max_health; flare ignite_radius, burn_dps, burn_seconds, light_seconds, light_range; bolt head_bonus, lie_seconds (it can be picked up again)."
